                "text": "Georgia has the highest maternal mortality rate in the country. And it's even worse for women of color and low-income communities. \nWhy? Because our healthcare system is broken, and women don't have the reproductive healthcare they need. Step 1? #ExpandMedicaid and #FixACA.",
